{"about":["ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN is a standalone adventure within the ELDEN RING universe, crafted to offer players a new gaming experience by reimagining the game’s core design.","RISE TOGETHER","Join forces with other players to take on the creeping night and the dangers within featuring 3-player co-op.","BECOME A HERO","Take command of uniquely skilled heroes, each possessing their own abilities and distinct flair. While individually formidable, their skills create powerful synergies when they unite as a team.","TAKE ON THE NIGHT","Overcome a relentless environmental threat that sweeps through a land that changes between each game session and defeat the magnificent boss of that night!","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/1d7f60c58f6efbe48079d1ff8773c49c32c341c9ae992e0f.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/1d7f60c58f6efbe48079d1ff8773c49c32c341c9ae992e0f.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/7a8b663566237f74b48758e7faba85ff9e3f565178e82253.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/7a8b663566237f74b48758e7faba85ff9e3f565178e82253.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/3f7a14ea16c9a1d4a0a1c7da885d47976d059560fe56f877.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/3f7a14ea16c9a1d4a0a1c7da885d47976d059560fe56f877.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202412/1301/45e68fda0fcfe7fe3523b5012ab9af14e88db2a1387388af.jpg?